# Input
```css
/* should not generate diagnostics */

/* Escaped class names are matched by their value (#13078). */

/* `.foo\+bar` is the class `foo+bar` */
.foo\+bar {
	color: blue;
}

/* A hex escape: `.a\31 b` is the class `a1b` */
.a\31 b {
	color: red;
}

/* A class that starts with a digit: `.\31 23` is the class `123` */
.\31 23 {
	color: green;
}

```
